    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have expanded your arsenal of techniques for agile strikes.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Trick Attack class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the ability to use trick attack with all weapons you are proficient with, even weapons which do not possess the operative property or are compatible with weapon finesse.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/starfinder-to-pathfinder#toc75\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
